<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Holy Paladins</span></h2>This is an example of the best-in-slot gear from all PvE sources available before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width">
<div id="dsf67g4d-bis-lists">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-first-in-row="true" data-href="#bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/achievement_jadeserpent.jpg");'></span>Pre-Raid Opening</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-msv-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></span>MSV Release</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-hof-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendary_breathofblackprince_agi.jpg");'></span>HoF Release</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#bis-lists-toes-release" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.jpg");'></span>ToES Release</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic prior to Mogu'Shan Vaults opening and Celestial dungeons becoming available. For those willing to PvP, note that equipping both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84914/malevolent-gladiators-ornamented-spaulders">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Ornamented Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_pvppaladin_e_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Ornamented Spaulders</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84831/malevolent-gladiators-ornamented-gloves">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Ornamented Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_pvppaladin_e_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Ornamented Gloves</span></a> for the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=58000/holy-shock-bonus">2-set bonus</a> will out perform the shoulder and glove options presented below.<br/>
<br/>
