<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Holy Paladins</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This includes Treasures, like <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86527/blade-of-the-poisoned-mind">
<img alt="Blade of the Poisoned Mind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_mantid_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blade of the Poisoned Mind</span></a>, but also World Bosses, such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>Galleon drops many powerful 496-iLvl items, which are all better than anything available from dungeons:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90423/chestguard-of-the-unbowed-back">
<img alt="Chestguard of the Unbowed Back" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidpaladin_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chestguard of the Unbowed Back</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90445/firerider-treads">
<img alt="Firerider Treads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_raidpaladin_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firerider Treads</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90416/crown-of-ranging-invasion">
<img alt="Crown of Ranging Invasion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raidpaladin_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of Ranging Invasion</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90454/girdle-of-the-galloping-giant">
<img alt="Girdle of the Galloping Giant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidpaladin_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Girdle of the Galloping Giant</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90430/stomphowl-pendant">
<img alt="Stomphowl Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stomphowl Pendant</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90434/steaming-seal-of-flame">
<img alt="Steaming Seal of Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_150.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Steaming Seal of Flame</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a headstart on your Tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90909/intemperate-greatboots">
<img alt="Intemperate Greatboots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Intemperate Greatboots</span></a>, a decent pair of early Boots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> World Drops</span></h3>There are two relevant BoE world drops for Holy Paladin in Mists of Pandaria, a necklace and a cloak:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90590/dorians-necklace-of-burgeoning-dreams">
<img alt="Dorian's Necklace of Burgeoning Dreams" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_106.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dorian's Necklace of Burgeoning Dreams</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90589/dirls-drafty-drape">
<img alt="Dirl's Drafty Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dirl's Drafty Drape</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Holy Paladin</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Holy Paladin, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> to get your hands on <a class="q7 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=92522/grand-commendation-of-the-klaxxi">
<img alt="Grand Commendation of the Klaxxi" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_faction_klaxxi.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grand Commendation of the Klaxxi</span></a> at <span class="rep-revered">Revered</span>, speeding up progress towards <span class="rep-exalted">Exalted</span> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90858/seal-of-the-prime">
<img alt="Seal of the Prime" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_143.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Prime</span></a>. <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1270/shado-pan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan</span></a> is a good second choice for access to trinkets early on, at <span class="rep-honored">Honored</span>.<div data-inserted-ad-group="1" style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
<div data-ad="inline-leaderboard" data-multiformat="true" id="ad_inline-leaderboard_1" style="width: 728px; height: 250px; background: rgba(136, 136, 136, 0.133); --ad-width: 728px; --ad-height: 250px;">
<div data-house-ad="true" data-house-show-before-ad-request="" style="width: 728px; height: 90px;">
<a href="https://tidd.ly/3XmfGSw" target="_blank">
<img alt="ad" src="//r2.rev.iq/wowhead.com/House_BlizzGear_Plushies_728x90.webp"/></a></div></div></div>
